    "long_instructions": "## Predict & Run\r\n\r\nDo This:\r\n\r\nRead the program. Before you run it, predict:\r\n- What will each Song line print?\r\n- What will the Total be?\r\n- What will the Average be?\r\n\r\nRun the program and compare your prediction with the output.",
    "start_sources": {
      "files": {
        "0": {
          "id": "0",
          "name": "main.py",
          "contents": "# Playlist Timer\ntotal = 0\nfor j in range(5):\n    song_length = 3 + j\n    total = total + song_length\n    print(\"Song \" + str(j + 1) + \": \" + str(song_length) + \" min\")\nprint(\"Total: \" + str(total) + \" min\")\nprint(\"Average: \" + str(total / 5) + \" min\")",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
